{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/985349-answers-to-my-questions","id":985349,"title":"Answers to my questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-11T04:25:27-07:00","id":985349,"title":"Answers to my questions","content":"A while back, I posted a question about certain splats that had not yet gotten full game lines and where they could be found in the V20 universe. Here, I am posting the answers to my questions.<br /> <br /> The Imbued, from Hunter: the Reckoning, can be found in Hunters Hunted II. Mummies can be found in Guide to the Tal'Mahe'Ra. Demons from Demon: the Fallen (specifically, the Archdukes of Hell) can also be found in Guide to the Tal'Mahe'Ra. The Wan Kuei (also known as the Kuei-jin) can be found in W20 Changing Breeds and (I believe) in the upcoming Shattered Dreams. Finally, a competitor to the Orpheus Group, Terrell &amp; Squibb, can be found in Guide to the Tal'Mahe'Ra. Orpheus itself will probably be detailed in Wraith 20 as well as the upcoming Ghost Hunters supplement.<br /> <br /> Hope this is helpful to others who had the same question I did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T09:57:35-07:00","id":985480,"title":"","content":"The hunters from <i>The Hunters Hunted II</i> are not QUITE the imbued from <b>Hunter: the Reckoning</b>, but they are about as close as we have seen in Twentieth Anniversary/Fourth Edition publications so far. The rules for mummies in <i>V20 Black Hand: Guide to the Tal'Mahe'Ra</i> are really stripped down, but they are serviceable as a one-page rule set can be.<br /> <br /> Further, the pre-Tradition mages of <b>Dark Ages: Mage</b> rules can be found in <i>V20 Black Hand: Guide to the Tal'Mahe'Ra</i>. There are likely to be rules \u2013 in some form or other \u2013 for the Laibon from <i>Kindred of the Ebony Kingdom</i> in the <b>V20</b> <i>Beckett's Jyhad Diary</i>, and it also shall contain rules for dhampires, the 'half-vampire' breeds first described in <i>Kindred of the East</i>. <br /> <br /> ...I mean, all for the sake of completeness, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T17:35:30-07:00","id":987013,"title":"","content":"Shattered Dreams does not contain the Wan Kuei enough to be useful, though it does mention such beings in passing due to their involvement with the War of Shame.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapes